###Request
POST https://Testresources.virginatlantic.com/dev/checkinmicroservice/CheckIn/SaveContactTracing HTTP/1.1

$[?(@.travelPartyId == 'TSCONTACT-travel-party')]

###Response
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "onlineCheckInStatus": {
    "available": false,
    "code": "contact-tracing-advisory",
    "message": "Check-in cannot continue."
  }
}
